    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24961" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δια-κλίνω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῑ</span>] <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>turn away, retreat from,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς ἀγορᾶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					11.9.8
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπό τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					6.41.11
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c. acc.,
				<i>evade, shun,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				35.4.6
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φίλημα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Alex.</u>
					54
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>bend,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πῆχυν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>Im.</u>
					2.18
				</span></i>
			.</div>
